WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:18.434
Roxy stomped her tiny foot.

2
00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.928
"Nobody shrinks Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:23.528
The little girl now looked like a giant.

4
00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:26.963
Roxy watched the girl skip away.

5
00:00:26.964 --> 00:00:30.150
"La, la, la!" the girl sang.

6
00:00:30.151 --> 00:00:34.123
Roxy flew after the girl and fired her eye laser beams.

7
00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:41.115
Whiz-hoo! The tiny laser beams bounced off the girl's neck.

8
00:00:41.116 --> 00:00:43.420
Roxy fired again and again.

9
00:00:43.421 --> 00:00:47.391
Whiz-hoo! Whiz-hoo!

10
00:00:47.392 --> 00:00:52.138
"What was that?" the girl said, feeling her neck.

11
00:00:52.139 --> 00:00:58.179
"It feels like mosquitoes are biting me."

12
00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:01.403
The girl skipped some more.

13
00:01:01.404 --> 00:01:05.864
Then she looked up at Metro City Grand Hotel.

14
00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:10.036
"That's a cute building!" said the girl.

15
00:01:10.037 --> 00:01:12.993
She aimed the device at the building.

16
00:01:12.994 --> 00:01:16.519
"I have to stop this girl," thought Roxy.

17
00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:19.500
"But how? I'm too small."

18
00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:21.526
Roxy thought for a moment.

19
00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:24.352
Then she had an idea.

20
00:01:24.353 --> 00:01:28.075
Zoom! Roxy flew inside the device.

21
00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:31.394
She could see all sorts of wires and gears.

22
00:01:31.395 --> 00:01:36.115
Roxy fired her eye laser beams again. Whiz-hoo!

23
00:01:36.116 --> 00:01:42.855
Ka-boom! Roxy flew back out as the device exploded in the girl's hand.

24
00:01:42.856 --> 00:01:46.097
The girl looked down at the broken device.

25
00:01:46.098 --> 00:01:49.633
She sniffed. Her lip shook.

26
00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:52.065
Tears filled her eyes.

27
00:01:52.066 --> 00:01:56.881
"Waa-aa! Waa-aa!" the girl cried.

28
00:01:56.882 --> 00:02:02.562
"My shrink ray is broken!"

29
00:02:02.563 --> 00:02:05.713
Suddenly a man and woman ran toward her.

30
00:02:05.714 --> 00:02:09.591
They were both wearing space suits.

31
00:02:09.592 --> 00:02:11.845
"Abba!" said the man.

32
00:02:11.846 --> 00:02:15.969
"Your mom and I were looking for you."

33
00:02:15.970 --> 00:02:20.362
"The shrink ray is broken!" Abba cried.

34
00:02:20.363 --> 00:02:24.958
"You're not supposed to play with that!" said the girl's mom.

35
00:02:24.959 --> 00:02:27.825
Her dad looked around and frowned.

36
00:02:27.826 --> 00:02:32.606
"You shrank a bunch of things for your collection, didn't you?"

37
00:02:32.607 --> 00:02:34.190
Abba nodded.

38
00:02:34.191 --> 00:02:37.907
"You shouldn't do that," said her mom.

39
00:02:37.908 --> 00:02:41.319
"I'm sorry," said Abba.

40
00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:44.560
"You're grounded," said her dad.

41
00:02:44.561 --> 00:02:46.541
Abba's mom rubbed her chin.

42
00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:50.567
"I'll get the un-shrink ray."

43
00:02:50.568 --> 00:02:54.177
Roxy flew up to Abba's mom.

44
00:02:54.178 --> 00:02:59.233
"Hi!" said Roxy. "Can you un-shrink people?"

45
00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:02.481
"Of course," said Abba's mom.

46
00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:06.659
"And all the buildings and everything else too."

47
00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.690
"Great!" said Roxy.

48
00:03:08.691 --> 00:03:10.749
She thought for a second.

49
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:15.564
"There's one building that can stay small though."

50
00:03:15.565 --> 00:03:18.453
Metro City was soon back to normal.

51
00:03:18.454 --> 00:03:23.054
Everything and everyone was the right size.

52
00:03:23.055 --> 00:03:29.864
Abba and her parents returned to space.

53
00:03:29.865 --> 00:03:33.674
Roxy and her friends walked home from school.

54
00:03:33.675 --> 00:03:39.113
"Look!" cried Mara. "The old theater is gone!"

55
00:03:39.114 --> 00:03:41.240
"Wow," said Jack.

56
00:03:41.241 --> 00:03:45.420
"Maybe people can plant that community garden now."

57
00:03:45.421 --> 00:03:48.603
Terrell looked at the empty lot suspiciously.

58
00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:52.693
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with this."

59
00:03:52.694 --> 00:03:56.753
Roxy smiled. "Who knows?

60
00:03:56.754 --> 00:03:58.509
But there's the bakery!

61
00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:06.398
Let's buy some cookies!"
